# Laptop smoke test of the harness (8-core Ryzen 7 5825U, Open MPI 4.1.6, GCC 13):
# KERNELS RANKS THREADS DECK THP. clover_bm_short.in = 960^2, 87 steps, ~6 s per run.
# The thp=off row needs NOTHP=<path to a compiled perf/microbench/nothp.c>.
c       1 8 clover_bm_short.in on
c       1 8 clover_bm_short.in off
c       8 1 clover_bm_short.in on
fortran 8 1 clover_bm_short.in on
